+<html><body>GM Helper Bora:<br>
+(These butlers... They don't even understand cat language... Tsk!)<br>
+Hm... Hello! I'm Bora, and I love my butlers.<br>
+I came to Aden to give a buff in place of my butler GM.<br>
+I'm pretty busy kneading, so I don't have much time.<br>
+So come at the right time!<br>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass -h Script BoraGMHelper page3">Receive the Master's Blessing buff (%buff_duration%).</Button>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="RETURN" action="bypass -h Script BoraGMHelper page1">Back</Button>
+</body></html>
