+<html><body>GM Helper Bora:<br>
+These are the buffs I've prepared! Do you like the buffs full with my love?<br1>
+<font color="LEVEL">- Fever Melody - Bora</font><br1>
+<font color="LEVEL">- Drumbeat of Serenity - Bora</font><br1>
+<font color="LEVEL">- Fantasia Harmony - Bora</font><br1>
+<font color="ee706a">- Noblesse Blessing</font><br1>
+<font color="ee706a">- Santiago's Royal Soup - Bora</font><br1>
+
+However, there's one thing you must be aware of, meow! If you receive a new buff while the <font color="ee706a">Celestial Cocktail</font> buff is in effect, only <font color="ee706a">Noblesse Blessing</font> and <font color="ee706a">Santiago's Royal Soup - Bora</font> will apply, meow! Make sure to double check before receiving the buff, meow!<br1>
+But if you have the <font color="LEVEL">Special Cocktail</font> buff, all existing buff will be removed and replaced with the buffs above, meow!<br1>
+
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="NORMAL" action="bypass -h Script BoraGMHelper give_buffs">Receive the Master's Blessing.</Button><br1>
+<Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="RETURN" action="bypass -h Script BoraGMHelper page2">Back</Button>
+
+</body></html>
